sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    participant User
    participant Main as Main Pipeline
    participant Detection as Detection Phase
    participant Processing as Processing Phase
    participant Output as Output Phase
    
    User->>Main: Execute ProcessVideo()
    Main->>Main: Initialize (SAM 3, VLM)
    Main->>Detection: Run Multi-Object Detection
    
    par Hand Detection
        Detection->>Detection: SAM 3 Session 1
        Detection->>Detection: Detect hands
    and Object Detection
        Detection->>Detection: SAM 3 Session 2
        Detection->>Detection: Detect object
    end
    
    Detection-->>Main: Return mask dictionaries
    Main->>Processing: Process frames
    
    loop For each frame
        Processing->>Processing: Get masks
        Processing->>Processing: VLM analysis (if interval)
        Processing->>Processing: Visualize
        Processing->>Output: Annotated frame
    end
    
    Output->>User: Display/Write video
    Main-->>User: Complete
